  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## What Gets Shown\r\n\r\n1. **Observe**\r\n   * Run the code. Look at the yellow \"Top Pick\" card and options displayed.\r\n   * What do you notice about the options displayed compared with options included in the dataset?\r\n\r\n2. **Prompt (P)**\r\n   * Ask the AI: *\"I have a list of objects called `activities`. I want to swap the object at index 0 with the object at index 3. How do I do that?\"*\r\n\r\n2. **Analyze (A)**\r\n\t* Look at the code provided by the AI and ask questions about any parts you don't fully understand.\r\n\r\n3. **Implement (I)**\r\n   * Based on the AI's advice, write code *before* the `renderFeatured()` call to change the order. **Goal:** Make \"Robotics Club\" appear in **Slot 1**.\r\n\r\n4. **Reflect (R)**\r\n   * Answer the questions in your activity guide",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
